 - Archived projects reject all writes with 409 (reads still work).
+- Freezing a project is allowed to its managers only (others who can read get
+  403, archived projects 409). It makes every member, managers included, a
+  viewer, so nobody can change the project's tasks afterwards, and it
+  unassigns the project's tasks (an assignee must be a contributor or manager).
+  There is no unfreeze, and a second freeze is 403 because the caller is now a viewer.
